stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> draft: POST /lab-billing/invoices
    draft --> draft: PATCH invoices/id
    draft --> issued: POST invoices/id/issue
    draft --> void: POST invoices/id/void
    issued --> partially_paid: payment or advance allocated
    issued --> paid: allocation or credit note clears balance
    partially_paid --> paid: allocation covers balance
    paid --> partially_paid: reversal or credit note releases money
    partially_paid --> issued: all allocations released
    issued --> void: POST invoices/id/void, nothing paid or credited
    void --> [*]
